{"rows":[{"cols":[{"designInfo":{"stencilSuperIds":["Output"],"stencilId":"cloud-output"},"label":"Sync complete","value":"<p>The Data X-Ray classifications sync has finished. Summary of what was changed in the Classifications domain:</p><ul><li><b>Created:</b> {{syncCreatedCount}} new asset(s)</li><li><b>Updated:</b> {{syncUpdatedCount}} existing asset(s) re-synced</li><li><b>Deleted:</b> {{syncDeletedCount}} orphan asset(s) removed</li><li><b>Skipped:</b> {{syncSkippedCount}} item(s) (missing name or unknown type)</li><li><b>Failed:</b> {{syncFailedCount}} item(s)</li></ul><p><b>Failures:</b> {{syncFailuresDisplay}}</p><p>Full per-asset detail is in <code>dgc.log</code>. Click <b>Send</b> to close this workflow.</p>","defaultValue":false,"size":12,"ignore":false,"visible":true,"enabled":true,"isRequired":false,"id":"syncResultsSummary","type":"htmlComponent"}]}],"metadata":{"key":"syncResultsForm","name":"Sync Results","description":"Displays counts and failures after the Data X-Ray classifications sync runs.","version":"1","modelType":"form","flowableDesignVersion":3110,"palette":"flowable-core-form-palette"}}
